    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly present this exceptional three-bedroom duplex penthouse enviably positioned on the 7th and 8th floors with panoramic views over Elm Park Golf Course. Boasting a west-facing aspect, the property offers exceptional natural light, privacy, and a serene atmosphere—all in the heart of prestigious Dublin 4. Other special features include a striking double-height living space with floor-to-ceiling glazing, impressive mezzanine with home working station, a generous terrace, and two designated underground parking spaces.\r\n\r\nElm Park is situated just off the Merrion Road with exceptionally landscaped communal gardens, on-site amenities, and a short walk to the DART, Merrion Strand, and St. Vincent’s Hospital.\r\n\r\nThe spacious and light-filled interior extends to approx. 144.5 sq. m. and is presented in excellent decorative condition comprising on the lower level of an entrance hallway, open-plan living/kitchen/dining space with granite worktops and integrated appliances, a large west-facing terrace and two double bedrooms, one with en-suite, the other with Jack-and-Jill access to the main bathroom. On the upper level is a mezzanine and the third primary bedroom with it's own en-suit and terrace.\r\n\r\nThis exquisite penthouse combines luxury, space, and location. Viewing is essential to truly appreciate all it has to offer.\r\n\r\nMore about the location...\r\n\r\nElm Park is an award-winning, 17-acre campus with on-site amenities, including the Giraffe creche, the Epicurean Specialty Food & Wine outlet, The Art of Coffee cafe, the Fianna Gym & Wellness Centre, and The Club at Elm Park which organises a range of activities for residents.\r\n\r\nThere is easy access to public transport links, including the DART and the Dublin Bus QBCs, local retail and leisure amenities at the Merrion Centre, Donnybrook, Sandymount and Blackrock Villages and is an easy commute to Ballsbridge and Dublin City Centre. The scheme is within easy reach of pleasant seaside walks at both Merrion Strand, and the UCD Belfield Campus, and is close to St. Vincent's Hospital and the RTE Studios."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall (5.32m x 3.12m)\r\nWelcoming L-shaped hallway with solid oak flooring.\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining/Kitchen (7.23m x 5.67m)\r\nIncredible living space with double height ceiling with a fantastic sense of light. Solid oak flooring. Air conditioning. Fully equipped kitchen.\r\n\r\nTerrace (7.51m x 1.82m)\r\nSpacious and private sun drenched west facing terrace overlooking Elm Park Golf club.\r\n\r\nMain Bedroom (5.64m x 5.21m)\r\nSpacious bedroom with carpet flooring and access to a generous east facing terrace benefiting from morning sun. View of the Poolbeg towers.\r\n\r\nEn-suite (2.73m x 1.69m)\r\nFully tiled with granite countertop, three-piece suite including bath with shower fitting, wash hand basin and WC.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (4.68m x 2.70m)\r\nLarge double bedroom with carpet flooring and floor to ceiling windows.\r\n\r\nEn-suite (2.29m x 1.37m)\r\nFully tiled with a WC, WHB and shower cubicle.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (4.32m x 2.82m)\r\nDouble bedroom complete with carpet, access to the guest WC and floor to ceiling windows.\r\n\r\nGuest WC (2.34m x 1.82m)\r\nJack-and-Jill style bathroom with dual access to the hallway and third bedroom. Fully tiled 3 piece bathroom including a bath with shower fitting, wash hand basin and WC.\r\n\r\nMezzanine (5.12m x 2.39m)\r\nSpacious mezzanine with home working station overlooking the living space.\r\n\r\nStairway (1.80m x 3.50m)\r\nOak timber feature stair case leading to the upper level.\r\n\r\nLanding (5.20m x 1.10m)\r\nLanding area with solid oak flooring and a second entrance door to the property.\r\n\r\nALL MEASUREMENTS ARE APPROXIMTE AND FOR GUIDANCE ONLY"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Stunning duplex penthouse.\r\nIncredible living space with double height ceiling.\r\nStunning setting overlooking Elm Park Golf & Sports Club.\r\nVery private.\r\nThree double bedrooms and three bathrooms.\r\nTwo secure designated car spaces.\r\nGenerous sun drenched west-facing terrace.\r\nSuperb Dublin 4 location within walking distance to Booterstown and Sydney Parade DART stations.\r\nWell managed campus with landscaped communal areas.\r\nMonitored CCTV security system throughout the development.\r\nAir conditioning."
      },
      {
